            ht: ["Maryaj se yon alyans lòm pa dwe kase (Matye 19.6)", "Angajman pwouve nan dire, pa nan bèl jou", "Kòd twa bwen ak Bondye pa kase (Ekl 4.12)", "Renouvle ve yo pa mil chwa chak jou (Oze 2.19-20)"],
            en: ["Marriage is a covenant no one should break (Mt 19:6)", "Commitment proves itself over time, not in good days", "The three-strand cord with God is not broken (Ecc 4:12)", "Renew your vows through a thousand daily choices (Hos 2:19-20)"],
            es: ["El matrimonio es un pacto que nadie debe romper (Mt 19:6)", "El compromiso se prueba con el tiempo, no en los buenos días", "El cordón de tres hilos con Dios no se rompe (Ecl 4:12)", "Renovar los votos con mil decisiones diarias (Os 2:19-20)"],
