            ht: "Ekri ansanm (oswa pou kont ou, nan lapriyè pou fwaye w a lavni) yon fraz angajman renouvle : « Kèlkeswa sa k rive, mwen chwazi... » Kole l nan yon kote vizib nan kay la. Apre sa, site yon « tanpèt » w ap travèse kounye a e remèt li klèman bay Bondye, twazyèm bwen kòd ou a.",
            en: "Write together (or alone, in prayer for your future home) a sentence of renewed commitment: \"Whatever happens, I choose to...\" Post it somewhere visible in the house. Then name a \"storm\" you are currently facing and explicitly hand it over to God, the third strand of your cord.",
